  "ghelp_earn_title": "Earning sunlight",
  "ghelp_earn_detail": "Focus during the day to earn sunlight: +{perMinute} ☀ per minute;\nfinish a growth task check-in for extra sunlight based on focus time;\ncomplete an eye-care break for +{eyeCare} ☀.",
