  "ghelp_use_title": "Spending sunlight",
  "ghelp_use_detail": "Plant in the garden (tap an empty pot): common plants cost {sunCost} ☀ or {fragmentCost} fragments;\nwater plants from {waterCost} ☀/time, fertilize from {fertCost} ☀/time;\ndig up a plant you don't want to get half the sunlight back;\nor redeem rewards you like in the Store.",
