  "ghelp_grow_title": "How plants grow",
  "ghelp_grow_detail": "Plants grow on their own over time; watering +{waterGain}% and fertilizing +{fertGain}% speeds it up\n(re-growth after blooming gives less — check the numbers on the buttons;\nup to {waterMax} waterings and {fertMax} fertilizings a day, {interval} minutes apart);\nwhen progress is full it blooms; after {bloomDays} days in bloom it fades, then can bloom again 🌻",
