  "ghelp_wilt_title": "Keep plants from wilting",
  "ghelp_wilt_detail": "Watering or fertilizing refreshes the timer; {wiltDays} days without water means wilting,\nand {deathDays} more days means the plant dies. If it wilts, don't worry:\nwithin {hardDays} days, watering brings it back; later it takes {hardWater} waterings\nand {hardFert} fertilizings. Come visit often 🌱",
