  "ghelp_task_title": "Task check-ins & parent approval",
  "ghelp_task_detail": "There are two kinds of growth tasks:\n\"Start focus\" tasks settle automatically when the goal is met;\nfinishing early still counts — sunlight is given for the time you actually focused;\n\"I did it\" tasks are recorded as \"waiting for parent approval\" —\nsunlight arrives only after a parent approves.",
  "ghelp_bloom_title": "Blooming surprises",
  "ghelp_bloom_detail": "Blooming brings surprises: at least +{instantSun} ☀, plus a chance of\nbonus sunlight, rare fragments, or seeds of the same species;\nduring bloom a morning-dew reward drops every morning —\ncare for the plant the day before and the reward is fuller. Come collect 🌸",
