  "species_lore_sunflower_intro": "A golden face that follows the sun",
  "species_lore_sunflower_story": "Little sunflower watches the sun all day. Wherever the sun goes, it turns to follow. That is how it grew its shiny golden face — the brightest little sun in the garden.",
  "species_lore_tomato_intro": "Little red lanterns in a row",
  "species_lore_tomato_story": "Baby tomatoes start out green. As they soak up the sunshine, they blush redder and redder. When ripe, they hang on the vine like tiny lanterns.",
  "species_lore_strawberry_intro": "A heart-shaped berry with speckles",
  "species_lore_strawberry_story": "A strawberry is covered with tiny speckles. Each speckle is a real little seed! One berry can hide two hundred seeds.",
  "species_lore_moon_orchid_intro": "Blooms only under the moon",
  "species_lore_moon_orchid_story": "Moon orchid sleeps soundly all day. When the moon rises, it gently opens its petals. The flower brews moonlight into a soft scent that helps children drift to sleep.",
  "species_lore_coral_orchid_intro": "Pink like undersea coral",
  "species_lore_coral_orchid_story": "Legend says it is a dream of undersea coral resting on land. In that dream, pink flowers bloomed. Now little seashells whisper between its leaves.",
  "species_lore_jade_hydrangea_intro": "Many blooms hug into one ball",
  "species_lore_jade_hydrangea_story": "A jade hydrangea is dozens of tiny flowers holding hands. Even the strongest wind cannot blow them apart. Flowers that stick together are the prettiest.",
  "species_lore_grape_intro": "Bunches of little purple pearls",
  "species_lore_grape_story": "Grapes are little climbing champions! They use tiny curly tendrils as hands to climb up, step by step. And guess what — their flowers are so shy they open backwards: the fruit pops out before the tiny flower even blooms.",
  "species_lore_rose_intro": "A little guard with thorns",
  "species_lore_rose_story": "A rose wears its thorns like tiny armor, keeping its soft petals safe from hungry visitors. That lovely smell comes from little drops of oil hiding inside the petals — it takes heaps and heaps of petals to fill just one small bottle of rose perfume!",
  "species_lore_fallback_intro": "A little garden plant",
  "species_lore_fallback_story": "Every plant has its own little story, waiting for you to discover.",
  "praise_phrase_1": "Awesome! You just focused through a whole stretch of time!",
  "praise_phrase_2": "Amazing! Your sunflower is so happy for you!",
  "praise_phrase_3": "Your focus power just got a little bit stronger!",
  "praise_phrase_4": "Sticking with it is a superpower — and you did it!",
  "praise_phrase_5": "Today is another sparkling day!",
  "praise_phrase_6": "Way to go! One step closer to a full jar of sunlight!",
  "praise_phrase_7": "You look so cool when you concentrate!",
  "praise_phrase_8": "Every focus time makes you even more awesome!",
  "praise_phrase_9": "The sunflower says: thanks for working hard with me!",
  "praise_phrase_10": "Wow, you focused even better than yesterday!",
  "praise_phrase_11": "Small efforts, big growth!",
  "praise_phrase_12": "You're the best little sunshine ever!",
  "praise_phrase_13": "Well done! Give yourself a great big thumbs-up!",
  "praise_phrase_14": "When you focus, that's when you shine!",
  "praise_phrase_15": "More sunlight earned — keep it up!",
  "praise_phrase_16": "Another focus challenge done — you're amazing!",
  "praise_phrase_17": "Your sunflower sees all your hard work!",
  "praise_phrase_18": "Fantastic! Let's shine again tomorrow!",
  "praise_phrase_19": "Every bit of focus helps a flower bloom!",
  "praise_phrase_20": "You shine brighter than the sun when you focus!",
